    <div class="content" style="text-align:center;">
        <div class="reveal" style="display:inline-block;background:rgba(245,158,11,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.25);border-radius:40px;padding:0.28rem 1.1rem;font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f59e0b;margin-bottom:1.4rem;">Marina Investment Report · 2026</div>
        <h1 class="reveal" style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem);font-weight:900;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:1rem;">Marina Investment in<br><span style="color:#38bdf8;">Emerging Markets</span></h1>
        <p class="reveal" style="font-size:clamp(0.85rem,1.3vw,1rem);color:#94a3b8;max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 2rem;line-height:1.7;">A structural analysis of where global berth supply is collapsing, where capital is moving, and which emerging markets are positioned to capture the next wave of superyacht investment.</p>
