            <div style="text-align:center;"><div style="font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;">USD 19bn</div><div style="font-size:0.65rem;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-top:0.1rem;">Global marina market 2025</div></div>
