        <div id="map"></div>
        <div class="legend-grid">
            <div class="lc" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,0.06);border-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.2);"><div class="lc-t" style="color:#f59e0b;">● Mediterranean &amp; Caribbean</div><div class="lc-b">Traditional markets · Structurally saturated · Exporting demand outward</div></div>
            <div class="lc" style="background:rgba(248,113,113,0.06);border-color:rgba(248,113,113,0.2);"><div class="lc-t" style="color:#f87171;">● GCC · Middle East</div><div class="lc-b">Fastest growing until 2025 · Iran-US conflict repricing investment risk</div></div>
